# T_SCRE: a new item whose ADD cannot hold every field: long values,
# some escaped, fill the request, so the unknown location, which the
# form says it does not know as the cursor leaves it, goes into the
# following SET, which the server refuses with 202.  The item exists by
# then: the form is retitled with its ID and says some fields may not
# have been saved, the cursor goes to the location, and correcting it
# saves with a SET.
K INS
T CARD
K TAB TAB
T ISA VGA ADAPTER 16BT
K TAB SPACE TAB
T Paradise Systems Inc of Calif.
K TAB
T VGA Plus 16 professional board
K TAB
T SN 0001 0002 0003 0004 0005 06
K TAB
T Video adapter of "16" colours, "VGA" BIOS, feature connector
K TAB TAB CTRL-Y
T 12345
K TAB
T ZZZZZ
K CTRL-S
S PARTBOX
K ENTER
S PARTFLD
K CTRL-Y
T A1
K CTRL-S
S PARTOK
K ESC
